503 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 85 0 R
/E (Among the platforms compared in this report, Microsoft Power Apps can be identified as the best overall low-code platform because it provides the strongest balance between ease of development, AI capabilities, integration, automation, scalability and enterprise support.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
504 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 85 0 R
/E (However, the comparison also demonstrates that platform selection should be based on organizational requirements. Salesforce is particularly suitable for CRM-focused organizations, OutSystems and Mendix are strong choices for complex enterprise applications, Appian is highly suited to process automation, ServiceNow excels in IT and enterprise workflows, and Zoho Creator is particularly attractive for organizations seeking simple, rapid and cost-effective business application development.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
505 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 85 0 R
/E (Therefore, there is no universally superior low-code platform for every scenario. Nevertheless, when considering overall capability and versatility across a broad range of business applications, Microsoft Power Apps is the strongest overall choice.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [12]
>>
