/Title (Low-code application development is emerging as an important approach to modern software development. The technology is evolving beyond simple drag-and-drop application creation toward an ecosystem involving AI, Generative AI, automation, cloud computing, analytics, APIs, IoT, and citizen development.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 622 0 R
/Next 845 0 R
>>
endobj
738 0 obj
<<
/Title (However, organizations must address security, governance, scalability, data privacy, and vendor lock-in. Therefore, the future of application development is unlikely to be purely low-code or purely traditional. Instead, a hybrid model combining professional developers, citizen developers, low-code platforms, and AI is likely to become increasingly important.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 622 0 R
/Prev 846 0 R
>>
endobj
